d 'XTGAMFE': module to perform fixed-effects gamma regression with log link for strictly positive panel outcomes
d
d     xtgamfe fits a gamma regression with a log link and a fixed
d effect for each panel to a strictly positive outcome.  The   
d conditional mean is	     mu_it = exp(alpha_i + x_it'beta +
d offset_it).	 For any value of beta the fixed effects have a
d closed-form solution, so they are substituted out and the
d coefficients are    found by Newton's method on a criterion in
d beta alone.  That criterion is convex.  No indicator variables
d are created, and run	  time grows linearly with the number of
d observations. 
d
d KW: gamma regression
d KW: fixed effects
d KW: log link
d
d Requires: Stata version 15
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261114
d
d Author:  M. Christopher Roebuck,   RxEconomics LLC
d Support: email   mcr@@rxeconomics.com
d
